/workspaces/Docs/docker-stack.yml
==================================
docker stack deploy
docker stack ps mystack                 # Lihat status stack
docker service ls                       # Lihat services
docker service logs mystack_postgres    # Lihat logs service
docker stack rm mystack                 # Hapus stack (jika perlu)

Jika mau matikan Swarm dan kembali ke compose:
===============================================
docker stack rm mystack
docker swarm leave --force
docker compose up -d

Dari Compose → Stack (ke Swarm):
===============================================
docker compose down
docker swarm init
docker stack deploy -c docker-stack.yml mystack

Bolak-balik cepat tanpa Swarm leave:
===============================================
# Stack aktif → Compose
docker stack rm mystack
docker compose up -d

# Compose aktif → Stack
docker compose down
docker stack deploy -c docker-stack.yml mystack
